WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.680
Local Body Elections are coming up

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:09.360
and here in Waimakariri we’re electing community boards,  a council and a new mayor.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.460
We need candidates for all roles

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.100
so have you thought about representing your community?

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.180
Almost anyone can stand – and if elected

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.660
you’ll make decisions for the future of our District.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.080
Make a difference, nominations are open now.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:37.180
Grab the form or find out more at waimakariri.govt.nz/vote2019

